<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>椰青美式 CF-08 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}

.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#D4A017;background:#fef6e0;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}

.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#D4A017;color:#fff}
.level-item.med{background:#E8D5B0;color:#5a4f44}

.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#D4A017;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}

.index-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.index-item{background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center}
.index-item .label{font-size:9px;color:#b5aaa0}
.index-item .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#D4A017}
.index-item .desc{font-size:9px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:2px}

.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#D4A017}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#fdf2ee;color:#E8652D}
.roi-b.n{background:#fef6ec;color:#D4A574}
.roi-b.i{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.risk-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.risk-stars{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px}
.risk-stars .on{color:#D4A574}
.risk-stars .off{color:#ddd}

.launch{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.launch span{padding:5px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44}

.scene-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.scene-item{padding:5px 12px;background:#f0f6ec;color:#4a7a3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}

.dpair{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.dpair-item{flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center}
.dpair-item .name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a}
.dpair-item .price{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:2px}

.comp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.comp-item{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px}
.comp-item .tag{font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0}
.comp-item .tag.adv{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.copy-box{padding:10px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8;margin-top:6px}
.copy-box em{color:#D4A017;font-style:normal}

.tip-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}

.pay{padding:20px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf8f0,#f5ede5)}
.pay .lock-icon{font-size:28px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.pay h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:8px}
.pay ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:10px}
.pay ul li{font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;position:relative;line-height:1.6}
.pay ul li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:#5a8f3c;font-weight:700}
.pay .price-tag{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#D4A017;text-align:center;margin:10px 0 8px}
.pay .price-tag small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#b5aaa0}
.pay .btn{display:block;text-align:center;padding:11px;background:#D4A017;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.pay .note{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}

.ftr{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#bbb}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">CF-08 · ¥17</div>
  <h1>🥤 椰青美式</h1>
  <div class="sub">咖啡饮品线 · 摆摊 ✅ 夜市 ✅ 流动 ✅ 开店 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>椰青水咖啡</span>
    <span>清爽解腻</span>
    <span>夏日爆品</span>
    <span>比生椰清爽</span>
    <span>复购率高</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 · 清甜椰青咖啡</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润极高</span>
  <span class="level-item med">夏日爆款</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    椰青美式，近两年夏天咖啡赛道上最清爽的爆品。瑞幸的椰青美式上线即刷屏，小红书相关笔记超过30万篇——椰青水+浓缩的组合，踩中了消费者对"清爽不腻"的健康咖啡需求。<br><br>
    第一次喝椰青美式是在2022年夏天，朋友在夜市摆了个咖啡摊，顺手用椰青水兑浓缩做了一杯试试。椰青水的天然清甜裹着浓缩咖啡的醇苦，喝下去满口清爽，完全没有生椰拿铁那种厚重感。那天晚上，椰青美式几乎人手一杯。<br><br>
    这个产品的底层逻辑很清晰：<em>椰青水自带天然甜度和电解质</em>，直接替代了糖浆和牛奶，操作上比生椰拿铁还简单。成本才5.5元——椰青水成本约2元/杯，浓缩咖啡液约2.5元/杯，冰块约0.5元/杯，杯子配件约0.5元。卖17元一杯，利润11.5元，<em>毛利率209%</em>。<br><br>
    椰青美式还有一个天然优势：清爽度。生椰拿铁用的是椰浆+牛奶，口感偏厚重腻口；椰青美式用的是纯椰青水，清甜爽口，喝完不腻。这就是典型的<em>高毛利高复购的夏日清爽爆品</em>。夏天一杯冰椰青美式，消费者买了还想买。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">高</div><div class="desc">投入约500元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">低</div><div class="desc">简单好上手</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">极高</div><div class="desc">209%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">高</div><div class="desc">清爽解腻夏日刚需</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">17元/杯（480ml）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本</span><span class="v">5.5元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单杯利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#D4A017">11.5元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>椰青水成本</span><span class="v">约2元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>浓缩咖啡液成本</span><span class="v">约2.5元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>冰块/包装成本</span><span class="v">约1元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30杯日利润</span><span class="v">345元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50杯日利润</span><span class="v">575元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约500元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销20杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">1.5天</div><div>日销30杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销50杯</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>季节感知</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">夏季最强，其他季节推热椰青或椰青拿铁</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>口味接受度</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">椰青水国民接受度极高，老少皆宜</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>竞争风险</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">摆摊赛道椰青美式竞品不多，先发优势</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>出品一致性</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">椰青水+浓缩标准化，30秒出品</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>雪克杯 25元</span>
    <span>量杯 10元</span>
    <span>冰桶 60元</span>
    <span>封口机 300元</span>
    <span>杯子+盖 0.5元/套</span>
    <span>椰青水 5元/瓶（约2杯量）</span>
    <span>浓缩咖啡液 40元/盒</span>
    <span>冰块 3元/袋</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约500元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m长桌</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>半小时</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 写字楼周边</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 地铁口早高峰</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 大学城</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 购物中心外</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 夜市/集市</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 公园/景区</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">推荐搭配</div>
  <div class="story" style="font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;margin-bottom:8px">单品卖17元 → 客单价17元，组合购买力强</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰青美式 + 椰子冻</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价25元 · 客单价↑47%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰青美式 + 三明治</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价24元 · 客单价↑41%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dpair" style="margin-top:6px">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰青美式 + 椰子水</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价22元 · 客单价↑29%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰青美式 + 冰淇淋</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价28元 · 客单价↑65%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：瑞幸椰青美式（18-22元）</span><span class="tag adv">品牌溢价，摆摊更低</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：生椰拿铁（15-20元）</span><span class="tag adv">椰青水更清爽不腻</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：普通美式（10-15元）</span><span class="tag adv">椰青风味差异化明显</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    ✔ 椰青水成本极低（约2元/杯），利润空间巨大<br>
    ✔ 椰青水天然清甜，比生椰拿铁更清爽不腻<br>
    ✔ 出餐30秒一杯，高峰期不压单<br>
    ✔ 椰青美式颜值高，分层效果天然出片<br>
    ✔ 冰饮为主，夏天消费者复购极高<br>
    ✔ 椰青水富含电解质，健康概念加成
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    "椰青美式，比生椰拿铁清爽多了！"<br>
    "用的是天然椰青水，不是椰浆，一点都不腻"<br>
    "夏天来一杯，解暑又提神"<br>
    "第二杯半价，给朋友带一杯呗"<br>
    见年轻人路过喊：<em>"椰青美式，17块一杯，清甜清爽！比生椰拿铁好喝！"</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>椰青水别买加糖款</strong>——很多椰青水饮料加了白砂糖或果糖，喝起来甜腻，完全失去了椰青水的天然清甜感。推荐买100%纯椰青水（如If椰青水、Kara纯椰青水），配料表只有椰子水</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>浓缩液选对品牌</strong>——椰青水清甜度较高，浓缩如果太淡会被椰青水压住，太苦又盖住清甜。推荐中深烘浓缩液，平衡感好。隅田川/永璞/三顿半的中深烘款都合适</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>冰块量要足</strong>——椰青美式一定要加足冰块，480ml杯放满冰约180g。冰块融化过程中会逐渐稀释，让口感更清爽。不加冰的椰青美式像喝椰青水兑咖啡，层次感差很多</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>椰青水提前冷藏</strong>——椰青水本身口感最佳温度是4-8度。常温椰青水做出来口感偏酸，冷藏过的椰青水做出来清甜感提升一倍以上。建议整箱进货放冰柜</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>杯量不要太大</strong>——椰青美式建议用360-480ml杯，太大杯量椰青水比例过高，咖啡味被稀释太淡。最佳比例：200ml椰青水 + 36g浓缩 + 满冰</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>热饮版本也可以做</strong>——冬天做热椰青美式：椰青水微波加热60秒，加入浓缩，少冰或不加冰。成本不变，卖18元一杯也很好卖</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥39 解锁完整版</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方：椰青水品牌选品/浓缩液选品/冰块量精确到克</li>
    <li>完整工艺：椰青美式分层手法·冰量比例·杯量换算</li>
    <li>成本拆分：椰青水/浓缩液/冰块/包装/损耗逐项算清</li>
    <li>供应链信息：椰青水批发/浓缩品牌/纸杯厂商</li>
    <li>4种变体：热椰青美式/椰青Dirty/椰青气泡美式/椰青拿铁</li>
    <li>选址建议：写字楼/公园/大学城早高峰流量测算</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥39 <small>永久解锁</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="javascript:void(0)">📱 加微信 · 39元解锁配方</a>
  <div class="note">加好友备注"CF-08"优先通过</div>
</div>

<div class="ftr">
  <div>沧林 · 食品工业知识库</div>
  <div>微信 canglin1985 · foodintelai.com</div>
</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>